        "score": 5,
        "rationale": "Directly answers the question and explains why the evidence is insufficient for ancestry-stratified prevalence comparison."
      },
      "biomedical_factual_correctness": {
        "score": 5,
        "rationale": "Consistent with the evidence: no graph data, abstract mentions broad continental differences but does not provide detailed ancestry-stratified allele frequencies."
