        "score": 4,
        "rationale": "Addresses the main question and concludes insufficiency, but some supporting points are not well aligned with the provided evidence."
      },
      "biomedical_factual_correctness": {
        "score": 3,
        "rationale": "The conclusion is broadly correct, but it incorrectly suggests no population representation and no mention of risk alleles, despite the abstract describing African cohorts and baldness-associated SNPs."
